  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Children&#x2019;s rights - Uganda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Focus on the monitoring of child rights including improving state capacity to monitor and report to the UN Committe on the Rights of the Child; strengthening of national systems and building awareness and capacity of civil society to promote and defend child rights. Other Partners: Uganda Debt Network (UDN), MGLSD, Ministry of Justice, Law &amp; Order (JLOs), National Children&apos;s Authority, Civil Society Budget Advocacy Group (CSBAG), Uganda Parliamentary Forum for Children (UPFC)</narrative>
  </description>
